-- Annex 2: the Company's administrative procedures, "an inseparable part" of the terms.
-- A: the transaction receipt date; B: top-ups; C: premium holidays; D: partial
-- withdrawals; E: switches; F: changing the sum assured.
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are generated from line N of ../../source/raw/manulife-maxx.txt.
-- The letters A to C stand together on their own lines (src 937-941), and the second limb
-- of F iii comes before F's heading (src 1055-1058), from the two-column layout.
--
-- MINIMUMS. B, D, E and F each turn on a minimum ("mức tối thiểu", "số tối thiểu", "số dư
-- tài khoản tối thiểu") or a maximum number of transactions that the document never states
-- and never assigns to the Policy Schedule. Each is an input with no default (NOTES.md,
-- findings).

§ `Annex 2 — Administrative procedures`
-- src:932 | PHỤ LỤC 2
-- src:933 | THỦ TỤC HÀNH CHÍNH CÔNG TY
-- src:935 | (Phụ lục này là một phần không thể tách rời của …

§§ `A. Transaction receipt date`

-- i. A complete and valid document handed in at the cashier or customer-service counter
-- from 8:30 to 15:00 on a working day is received that day; after 15:00, on the next
-- working day. ii. The contract has no transaction awaiting a price.
-- A submission that is not complete and valid has no receipt date (Article 1, src 62-64).
-- Before 8:30, or on a day that is not a working day at or before 15:00, the Annex says
-- nothing; nor does it say what follows when a transaction is awaiting a price.
-- src:943 | Ngày nhận yêu cầu giao dịch:
-- src:944 | Ngày nhận yêu cầu giao dịch được xác định dựa vào các
-- src:945 | điều kiện sau:
-- src:946 | i. Ngày nhận yêu cầu giao dịch:
-- src:947 | • Giao dịch trong ngày: Chứng từ được nộp đầy đủ
-- src:948 | và hợp lệ tại quầy Thu ngân/quầy Dịch vụ khách
-- src:949 | hàng từ 8 giờ 30 đến 15 giờ trong ngày làm việc.
-- src:950 | • Giao dịch được tính sang ngày làm việc kế tiếp:
-- src:951 | Chứng từ nộp đầy đủ và hợp lệ tại quầy Thu
-- src:952 | ngân/quầy Dịch vụ khách hàng sau 15 giờ
-- src:953 | ii. Hợp đồng bảo hiểm không có giao dịch nào đang
-- src:954 | chờ giá.
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Annex 2 A does not say when a submission before 8:30, or on a day that is not a working day, is received` MEANS
    REFUSE "Annex 2 A does not say when a submission before 8:30, or on a day that is not a working day, is received"

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Annex 2 A does not say what follows when a transaction of the contract is awaiting a price` MEANS
    REFUSE "Annex 2 A does not say what follows when a transaction of the contract is awaiting a price"

@ref Annex 2 A (src 943-954); Article 1 (src 62-66)
GIVEN `the submission` IS A `A submission at the counter`
GIVETH A MAYBE DATE
`Annex 2 A — the transaction receipt date of` `the submission` MEANS
    BRANCH
      IF NOT (`the submission`'s `complete and valid`)            THEN NOTHING
      IF `the submission`'s `a transaction of the contract awaiting a price`
                                                                  THEN `Annex 2 A does not say what follows when a transaction of the contract is awaiting a price`
      IF `the minute of the day` GREATER THAN 15 TIMES 60         THEN JUST (`the submission`'s `next working day`)
      IF     `the submission`'s `on a working day`
         AND `the minute of the day` AT LEAST 8 TIMES 60 PLUS 30  THEN JUST (`the submission`'s `date`)
      OTHERWISE `Annex 2 A does not say when a submission before 8:30, or on a day that is not a working day, is received`
    WHERE
        `the minute of the day` MEANS `the submission`'s `hour` TIMES 60 PLUS `the submission`'s `minute`

§§ `B. Top-up premiums`

-- A written request on the Company's form. A payment is accepted as a top-up only when
-- every regular basic premium due is paid and every premium debt is paid; it may not be
-- below the minimum; in a policy year the top-ups may not exceed 10 times the regular
-- basic premium annualised at issue; it needs the Policyholder's consent and the Company's
-- approval. Annex 2 C bars top-ups during a premium holiday.
