@ref Annex 2 B (src 968-973)
GIVEN `the designation`       IS A MAYBE (LIST OF `An allocation to a fund`)
      `the latest allocation` IS A LIST OF `An allocation to a fund`
GIVETH A LIST OF `An allocation to a fund`
`Annex 2 B — the allocation of a top-up, designated` `the designation` `, the latest regular allocation being` `the latest allocation` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the designation`
    WHEN JUST d  THEN d
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `the latest allocation`

§§ `C. Premium holiday`

-- A written request on the Company's form; the surrender value when the holiday starts
-- must be enough to pay the risk premium, the policy fee and the rider premiums "under the
-- rule on the minimum payment period" — a rule the document never states. During the
-- holiday no rider may be added, the sum assured not increased, the frequency not changed,
-- and no top-up paid.
