@ref Annex 2 E (src 1012-1034)
GIVEN `the request` IS A `A switch request out of a fund`
GIVETH A `The effect of a switch out of a fund`
`Annex 2 E — the effect of` `the request` MEANS
    BRANCH
      IF NOT (`the request`'s `in writing on the Company's form`)
         THEN `refused: not requested in writing on the Company's form`                 -- i
      IF    `the request`'s `amount requested` LESS THAN `the request`'s `minimum switch`
         OR `the request`'s `amount requested` GREATER THAN `the request`'s `account value of the fund`
         THEN `refused: below the minimum switch or above the fund's account value`      -- ii
      IF `the request`'s `account value of the fund` MINUS `the request`'s `amount requested` MINUS `the request`'s `switching fee`
             LESS THAN `the request`'s `minimum balance`
         THEN `every unit of the fund is switched`
                  (`the request`'s `account value of the fund` MINUS `the request`'s `switching fee`)   -- iv
      OTHERWISE `the amount requested is switched` (`the request`'s `amount requested`)

@ref Annex 2 E iii (src 1019-1029); Article 13.4 (src 584-586)
GIVEN `the amount switched` IS A NUMBER
      `the switching fee`   IS A NUMBER
      `the bid price`       IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Annex 2 E iii — the units cancelled in the fund switched out of, for` `the amount switched` `and a fee of` `the switching fee` `at a bid price of` `the bid price` MEANS
    (`the amount switched` PLUS `the switching fee`) DIVIDED BY `the bid price`

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Annex 2 E v leaves the split of an unsplit switch to rules in force that the document does not contain` MEANS
    REFUSE "Annex 2 E v leaves the split of an unsplit switch to rules in force that the document does not contain"

@ref Annex 2 E v (src 1035-1038)
GIVEN `the split stated` IS A MAYBE (LIST OF `An allocation to a fund`)
GIVETH A LIST OF `An allocation to a fund`
`Annex 2 E v — the split of the switch, the request stating` `the split stated` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the split stated`
    WHEN JUST s  THEN s
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `Annex 2 E v leaves the split of an unsplit switch to rules in force that the document does not contain`

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Annex 2 E vii refers to a time stated in the contract, and the contract states none` MEANS
    REFUSE "Annex 2 E vii refers to a time stated in the contract, and the contract states none"

@ref Annex 2 E vii (src 1041-1045)
GIVETH A DATE
`Annex 2 E vii — the day a switch takes effect` MEANS
    `Annex 2 E vii refers to a time stated in the contract, and the contract states none`

@ref Annex 2 E vii (src 1043-1045)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 2 E vii — interest runs while a switch is pending` MEANS
    FALSE

@ref Annex 2 E viii (src 1046-1050)
GIVEN `the requests` IS A LIST OF (LIST OF `A unit-linked fund`)
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Annex 2 E viii — the switches counted for` `the requests` MEANS
    sum (map (GIVEN r YIELD 1) `the requests`)

§§ `F. Changing the sum assured`

-- After the free-look period the Policyholder may ask to change the sum assured: i. with
-- the Policyholder's consent and the Company's approval, a written request on the form,
-- evidence of insurability (for an increase only) "and/or" an additional premium "and"
-- the rider rules if any; ii. a change of at least the minimum; iii. the change takes
-- effect on the paid-to date if approved before it, and on "the next contract effective
-- date" if approved after it. The "and/or" list is read as: the written request always,
-- evidence of insurability and the additional premium for an increase (NOTES.md fork
-- register).
