-- src:1055 | • Nếu ngày Công ty chấp thuận yêu cầu của Bên
-- src:1056 | mua bảo hiểm sau “Ngày đã được trả phí”, ngày
-- src:1057 | hiệu lực thay đổi sẽ là ngày hiệu lực Hợp đồng
-- src:1058 | kế tiếp.
@ref Annex 2 F i and ii (src 1061-1074)
GIVEN `the request` IS A `A sum assured change request`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Annex 2 F — the sum assured may change on` `the request` MEANS
        `the request`'s `request date` GREATER THAN `the request`'s `end of the free-look period`
    ... `the request`'s `in writing on the Company's form`
    ... (    NOT (`the request`'s `an increase`)
         OR (    `the request`'s `evidence of insurability supplied`
             AND `the request`'s `additional premium paid`))
    ... `the request`'s `difference` AT LEAST `the request`'s `minimum difference`
    AND `the request`'s `approved by the Company`

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Annex 2 F does not define the next contract effective date` MEANS
    REFUSE "Annex 2 F does not define the next contract effective date"

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Annex 2 F says nothing of an approval on the paid-to date itself` MEANS
    REFUSE "Annex 2 F says nothing of an approval on the paid-to date itself"

@ref Annex 2 F iii (src 1075-1080, 1055-1058)
GIVEN `the request` IS A `A sum assured change request`
GIVETH A DATE
`Annex 2 F — the day the change of sum assured takes effect, on` `the request` MEANS
    BRANCH
      IF `the request`'s `date the Company approved` LESS THAN `the request`'s `paid-to date`
         THEN `the request`'s `paid-to date`
      IF `the request`'s `date the Company approved` GREATER THAN `the request`'s `paid-to date`
         THEN `Annex 2 F does not define the next contract effective date`
      OTHERWISE `Annex 2 F says nothing of an approval on the paid-to date itself`
